\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1. O Master Jesus Christ,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 A good Director,
\par We are under Thy care
\par no and evermore.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. Take good care of the sick,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 comfort all their souls.
\par and let them recover
\par and let them be well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  To all those our healers
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and all our helpers,
\par bless them and all their works,
\par \pard      Let it end them well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 4. Give spiritual healing
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 to our stained sins now,
\par Strengthen us in our faith
\par Let it end us well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  Those who are in trouble,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Oh comfort their souls;
\par Those who are in distress,
\par Let it end them well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.  O, repel all their thoughts
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 And all their worries,
\par Let all that you give us
\par be  acceptable.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.  Change the minds of all those
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 that who think evil
\par and let them forgiving
\par Those who tresspass them.\i 
\par \pard\i0\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

